(1a) SHIELDED REGIME  L_B >> beta:  fit -log F^(0) = A exp(-kappa_F L_B/beta) and
     I(A:C|B) = A' exp(-kappa_I L_B/beta) over L_B/beta >= 2.0.
     Continuum expectation: xi = v beta/(2 pi) = beta/pi sites (v = 2), so
     kappa_I = pi = 3.14159 and, if -log F ~ eta^2, kappa_F = 2 pi = 6.28319.
